---
import {site} from "../consts";

const sheet = [
  {
    label: 'Job',
    en: 'Game Designer / Developer (in training)',
  },
  {
    label: 'Home base',
    en: 'UofU, Junior (Senior loading...)',
  },
  {
    label: 'Hall of Fame',
    en: 'Story-driven games that make you think, like <em>What Remains of Edith Finch</em> and <em>Papers, Please</em>. Also, simple battle games, because sometimes you just want to hit things.',
  },
  {
    label: 'Passive skill',
    en: 'Documentation. I overthink everything, so I organize everything: projects, collabs, and even my daily life. Nothing feels as good as a clean doc... ^›⩊‹^♡',
  },
  {
    label: 'Cat',
    en: 'A gift from a teammate, drawn in MS Paint. Best portrait I own!',
  },
  {
    label: 'Quest',
    en: 'An internship. And, as a bonus, my graduation, which is running a little late (ETA: May 2028).',
    ko: '인턴십과 조금 늦게 오고 있는 제 졸업을 찾습니다...',
  },
];
---

<section class="about text-left">
  <div class="aside-widget">
    <img src={site.avatar} alt="" class="cat-icon"/>About Me
  </div>

  <div class="about-block">
    <p>Hi, I'm Seoyun, a student majoring in Games at the University of Utah (UofU). I'm a Junior right now, and Senior unlocks next semester. Expected graduation: May 2028.</p>
    <p class="ko">안녕하세요, 이서윤입니다! 현재는 UAC(University of Utah Asia Campus)에서 게임을 공부하고 있어요. 지금은 3학년이고, 졸업 예정은 2028년 5월이에요.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-block">
    <p>Current quest (Fall 2026): <em>Destine</em>, a turn-based roguelike card game where every card is a word. Merge multiple cards, get a new combination, and use it to fight your way through enemies.</p>
    <p class="ko">현재 진행 중인 팀 프로젝트는 <em>Destine</em>입니다. 모든 카드가 단어인 턴제 로그라이크 카드 게임이고, 여러 카드를 합쳐서 새 조합을 만들고 적과 싸워요.</p>
    <p>Follow its progress on Instagram / Destine 릴스 보러가기: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/werobstars/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@werobstars</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="sheet">
    {
      sheet.map((item) => (
        <div class="sheet-item">
          <div class="sheet-label font-side">{item.label}</div>
          <p set:html={item.en} />
          {item.ko && <p class="ko" set:html={item.ko} />}
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

</section>

<section class="about text-left">
  <div class="aside-widget">
    <span class="menu-icon">💻</span>About Site
  </div>

  <div class="about-block">
    <p><strong>Welcome, Gamer!</strong></p>
    <p>This is my little corner of the internet, built with Astro, hosted on GitHub Pages, and dressed up like an arcade cabinet that learned to code. The glitchy fonts are on purpose. The bugs are not, so please tell me if you spot one.</p>
    <p class="ko">글리치 폰트는 일부러 그런 거예요. 진짜 버그는 일부러가 아니니까, 발견하시면 꼭 알려주세요 (´_ﾉ`)</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-block">
    <p>The map is simple:</p>
    <ul class="map">
      <li><strong>Portfolio</strong>: the things I actually built. Interactive fiction, a 3D game, a board game, and a 3D card battler game still in progress.</li>
      <li><strong>Study</strong>: homework, practice, and notes from books. The messy points where the learning happens.</li>
      <li><strong>Message</strong>: a guestbook. Say hi!</li>
      <li><strong>Library</strong>: every post, sorted by category and tag.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="about-block">
    <p>If you want to talk games, collaborate, or just say hi, leave a note in Message or use the email button above!</p>
    <p class="ko">게임 이야기, 그냥 인사, 게임 추천 받아요 - Message 또는 이메일</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-block {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-block p + p,
  .sheet-item p + p {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .ko {
    opacity: 0.8;
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  .about a {
    color: rgb(var(--color-text-active));
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .cat-icon {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
    background-color: #D6D3CC;
  }

  .sheet {
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgb(var(--color-border));
  }

  .sheet-item {
    padding: 0.9rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgb(var(--color-border));
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .sheet-label {
    color: rgb(var(--color-text-active));
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .map li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
